1
00:00:01,458 --> 00:00:08,500
But I can't let them catch me.
I still have something important to do.

2
00:00:08,833 --> 00:00:09,875
Something you have to do?

3
00:00:10,666 --> 00:00:11,750
Kindaichi...

4
00:00:12,333 --> 00:00:15,000
Do you remember the fourth verse
of the curse song?

5
00:00:15,416 --> 00:00:16,708
The fourth verse?

6
00:00:18,458 --> 00:00:21,000
Descent of the Beautiful Goddess...

7
00:00:21,958 --> 00:00:22,583
Wait!

8
00:00:22,875 --> 00:00:23,625
Mayura!

9
00:00:24,333 --> 00:00:25,083
What?

10
00:00:26,291 --> 00:00:27,708
Mayura!

11
00:00:33,083 --> 00:00:36,583
Into the demon's abyss,
the beautiful goddess falls.

12
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,416
She used her own body
to complete the curse song...

13
00:00:44,083 --> 00:00:45,416
Why...?

14
00:00:46,083 --> 00:00:47,750
Why did it have to...

15
00:00:48,625 --> 00:00:51,541
Was there really nothing
I could have done?!

16
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,166
Hajime...

17
00:00:54,125 --> 00:00:55,750
Damn it!
